      <p>  <p>Stops critically damped motion</p>
  <p>Use in conjunction with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlMoveToTarget" target="_blank">llMoveToTarget</a></p>
  <p>To stop rotation movement use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlStopLookAt" target="_blank">llStopLookAt</a></p>
</p>
